OL,3,CInvestigation underway into cause of
OL,4,Cfire which gutted bungalows
OL,6,FPolice are investigating the cause of
OL,7,Fa fire in Holbury which left two
OL,8,Fbungalows partially destroyed.
OL,10,FCrews from across Hampshire, including
OL,11,FHightown, Totton and Gosport, were
OL,12,Fsent to the scene last Sunday to
OL,13,Ftackle the fire using several hoses
OL,14,Fand an aerial platform.
OL,16,FThey worked through the night to keep
OL,17,Fit under control and prevent it
OL,18,Fspreading to neighbouring properties
OL,19,Fon Rollestone Road.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/2
