OL,3,CInvestigation underway into cause of
OL,4,Cfire which gutted bungalows
OL,6,FResidents were told to keep windows
OL,7,Fand doors shut because of the smoke at
OL,8,Fthe scene and the public was asked to
OL,9,Fstay away from the area.
OL,11,FOn Monday, Hampshire and Isle of Wight
OL,12,FFire and Rescue Service said the fire
OL,13,Fhad been put out and teams were at the
OL,14,Fsite to carry out a series of
OL,15,Finspections.
OL,17,FIn the aftermath of the fire, the
OL,18,Fcollapsed roofs of both bungalows
OL,19,Fcould be seen along with the wreckage
OL,20,Fof two cars.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/2
